      },
      "art:pontuacao": 7,
      "art:texto": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Future systems could go further by reporting factuality measures along with generated text [83] or integrating a feedback mechanism for reporting inconsistent information in order to crowd-source these factuality checks."
