    },
    {
      "@id": "art:artigo_2203_00130v1_trabalho_futuro_3",
      "@type": "art:TrabalhoFuturo",
      "art:extraidoDe": {
        "@id": "art:artigo_2203_00130v1_secao_10"
      },
      "art:pontuacao": 7,
      "art:texto": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "We are excited to integrate new advances for measuring and ensuring factuality in generations (e.g., [33, 60, 77]) into Paper Plain to help realize the promise of such models in real-world settings."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "art:artigo_2304_02623v1_metodo_3",
      "@type": "art:Metodo",
      "art:extraidoDe": {
        "@id": "art:artigo_2304_02623v1_secao_3"
      },
      "art:pontuacao": 3,
      "art:texto": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For example, when starting writing a survey paper, the authors come up with the query to find relevant papers first, and AI helps execute the search and discover related documents; after authors read the retrieved papers and come up with ideas for the writing, AI can help generate the writing text based on authors' ideas, and the writers only need to proofread model output."
      }
    },
